
% All You Wanted

a: vi V | IV I |
In: $a*2
Vr: $a*2
cad1: viio |
cad2: viio | V |
b: vi | IV | I | V |
Ch: $b*4
link: $a
cad3: V |
c: IV | V |
cCad: IV I | ii I | viio | V |
bridge: $c*2 $cCad
instr: $b*2
ending_cadence: vi V | IV |
outro: $a $ending_cadence
S: [Ab] $In $Vr $cad1 $Vr $cad2 $Ch $link $Vr $cad3 $bridge $Ch $instr $Ch $link $outro
